# MpireOS: Meta+Space opens universal search (as Cmd+Space does on a Mac).
# Its own entry, rather than one more shortcut on KRunner's, so systems that
# already saved KRunner's shortcuts get it too. Tapping Meta on its own still
# opens the launcher (kwinrc [ModifierOnlyShortcuts]).
[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Universal Search
Comment=Search apps, files, settings, and more
Exec=mpire-shell --toggle search
Icon=search
NoDisplay=true
X-KDE-Shortcuts=Meta+Space
